{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1744719098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-PLAY SINGLE OR MULTIPLAYER MODE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Get to the top or stay on top before time runs out in a VERTICALLY TIGHTENING AREA!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Leave behind those who try to bring you down with guns and traps </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Shoot or Push your opponents, remember this is a battle royale and only one person can win! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start at one of four bottom towers and navigate obstacles to reach the top. Each floor has harder traps. Race to an area with two towers, facing more challenges. Use grappling hooks or special weapons to advance yourself or hinder opponents!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1744719098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/extras/GameContentsGif.gif?t=1744719098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-PLAY SINGLE or MULTIPLAYER MODE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-ZOMBIE MODE or SUPERHERO MODE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-ADD BOTS IN ANY MODE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1744719098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-CHECKPOINTS EVERY 30 METERS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-FAST COMEBACK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-VARIABLE JUMP HEIGHT (the longer you press the jump button, the higher you go)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-WEAPON WEIGHT IMPACT (each weapon has a different weight the more weapons you carry the slower you get)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-IK FOOT SLIDE(the foot shape is positioned according to the ground and you can slip and fall)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-HOOK WEAPON WILL HELP PLAYERS WHO FALL BEHIND TO MAKE EASY COMEBACKS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-MANY WEAPONS OF DIFFERENT TYPES AND CHARACTERISTICS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> -PUNCH!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1744719098\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2719810?t=1744719098","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2719810?t=1744719098","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/2c602cad6bebdbd68e3baad38d4e3d5b9912a499/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744719098","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/2c602cad6bebdbd68e3baad38d4e3d5b9912a499/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744719098","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719810/ext